@startuml
' componentDiagramEdgeLabelStyle node applies to every labelled link;
' -[nonode]-> opts one link out, and a hidden link leaves no label behind
skinparam componentDiagramEdgeLabelStyle node
component Client
component Server
database DB

Client --> Server : request / auth
Server -[nonode]-> DB : query
Client -[hidden]-> DB : invisible
@enduml
